  VALUE

016F   1683           00036      BANK1
0170   1406           00037      bsf     TRISB,0           ; SCL input (pull-up met a 1 ).
0171   1283           00038      BANK0
0172   0008           00039      return 
                      00040 ; fin routine SCL1 ------------------------------------------------------------  
